name: ['Acidic Slime', 'Ball Lightning', 'Beast Whisperer', 'Chord of Calling', 'Deadly Dispute', "Dovin's Veto", 'Dragonlord Atarka', 'Dramatic Reversal', 'Eternal Witness', 'Exalted Angel', 'Fyndhorn Elves', 'Glen Elendra Archmage', 'Goblin Rabblemaster', 'Harvester of Souls', 'Hornet Queen', 'Kalonian Hydra', 'Kor Haven', 'Loyal Retainers', 'Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind', 'Path of Ancestry', 'Serra Angel', 'Tarmogoyf', 'Temple of the False God', 'Terastodon', 'Urza, Prince of Kroog', 'Vindicate', 'Vito, Thorn of the Dusk Rose', 'Wall of Roots', 'Windfall', 'Wood Elves']
