text: ["Artifact creatures you control get +2/+2.\\n{6}: Create a token that's a copy of target artifact you control, except it's a 1/1 Soldier creature in addition to its other types.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact or creature.\\nDraw two cards and create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")', "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nSearch your library for a creature card with mana value X or less, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.", 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nWhen Acidic Slime enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever another nontoken creature dies, you may draw a card.', 'Defender\\nPut a -0/-1 counter on Wall of Roots: Add {G}. Activate only once each turn.', 'Destroy target permanent.', 'Each player discards their hand, then draws cards equal to the greatest number of cards a player discarded this way.', 'Flying, deathtouch\\nWhen Hornet Queen enters the battlefield, create four 1/1 green Insect creature tokens with flying and deathtouch.', 'Flying, trample\\nWhen Dragonlord Atarka enters the battlefield, it deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or planeswalkers your opponents control.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nWhenever Exalted Angel deals damage, you gain that much life.\\nMorph {2}{W}{W} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Flying\\nWhenever you draw a card, Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind deals 1 damage to any target.\\n{T}: Draw a card.', "Flying\\n{U}, Sacrifice Glen Elendra Archmage: Counter target noncreature spell.\\nPersist (When this creature dies, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Other Goblin creatures you control attack each combat if able.\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token with haste.\\nWhenever Goblin Rabblemaster attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each other attacking Goblin.', "Path of Ancestry enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. When that mana is spent to cast a creature spell that shares a creature type with your commander, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom.)", 'Sacrifice Loyal Retainers: Return target legendary creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only during your turn, before attackers are declared.', "Tarmogoyf's power is equal to the number of card types among cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nCounter target noncreature spell.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nHaste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Ball Lightning.", 'Trample\\nKalonian Hydra enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever Kalonian Hydra attacks, double the number of +1/+1 counters on each creature you control.', 'Untap all nonland permanents you control.', 'When Eternal Witness enters the battlefield, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Terastodon enters the battlefield, you may destroy up to three target noncreature permanents. For each permanent put into a graveyard this way, its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you gain life, target opponent loses that much life.\\n{3}{B}{B}: Creatures you control gain lifelink until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by target attacking creature this turn.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {G}.']
flavor: ['"(Z—>)90° — (E—N²W)90°t = 1"', '"Find shelter where none but the angels can reach you."\\n—Kor saying', '"Hol visto intere civiltà. sorgere e crollare. Voi mortali non siete che polvere per me."\\n—Sorin Markov', '"I have watched over this land since the first seedling emerged from the primeval soil."', '"It must be infuriating, to pour so much rage into your assault and see it wasted. Perhaps you\'ll learn something from this."', '"No symphony can compare to the melody of the ferrox\'s roar."', '"Nobody asked you to butt in, Jace. But thanks."\\n—Chandra Nalaar', '"That\'s a pretty ring! Trade you my knife for it."', '"The entire parish is gone. This was no execution. This was a massacre."\\n—Bishop Cawle of Elgaud', '"Through the blood of the wicked, we shall be redeemed. Let us pray."', '"To fill your mind with knowledge, we must start by emptying it."\\n—Barrin, master wizard', 'Every branch a crossroads, every vine a swift steed.', 'Incluso los báloths le temen cuando es su hora de comer.', 'It fears no sword and leaves no bones behind.', "She soars on wings of Serra's light, her sword of faith meting out justice to the wicked.", 'Sometimes the wise ones wove their magic into living plants; as the plant grew, so grew the magic.', "The most frightening storms are those not woven by nature's hand.", "The prince consort was happy to let Yotia's coffers fund his extravagant research.", 'Those who bring nothing to the temple take nothing away.', "What doesn't grow, dies. And what dies grows the tarmogoyf.", "When she's hungry, no one is safe.", '„Wir können den Wald ebenso wenig verlassen wie die Sterne den Nachthimmel."']
artist: ['Alayna Danner', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Daarken', 'Drew Tucker', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Greg Staples', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Irina Nordsol', 'Joshua Raphael', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Karla Ortiz', 'Kev Walker', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lie Setiawan', 'Mark Poole', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Stewart', 'Pete Venters', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Ryan Barger', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Solomon Au Yeung', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Warren Mahy']
